        "answer": {
          "short": "The values use different units; the correct range is $2920\\text{ g}$.\n\nConvert to grams before finding the maximum and minimum: $3000-80=2920$.",
          "worked": "The values use different units. Convert kilograms to grams before identifying the maximum and minimum.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}2\\text{ kg} &= 2000\\text{ g}\\\\3\\text{ kg} &= 3000\\text{ g}\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe maximum is $3000\\text{ g}$ and the minimum is $80\\text{ g}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Range} &= \\text{Max}-\\text{Min}\\\\\\text{Range} &= (3000-80)\\text{ g}\\\\\\text{Range} &= 2920\\text{ g}\\end{align*}$$",
